  <div class="talk"><h3>The First AI-Native Generation</h3><p>What sustained interaction with conversational AI does to development. The core research programme, presented as evidence and open questions rather than conclusions.</p></div>
  <div class="talk"><h3>Developmentally Responsible AI</h3><p>A framework for building systems that young people grow up inside. Practical, aimed at builders and regulators rather than ethicists.</p></div>
  <div class="talk"><h3>Digital Minds, Human Attribution, and Public Trust</h3><p>Why people believe machines have minds, what that belief does to institutions, and what follows for policy.</p></div>
